{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S13把“想听到以后不变的准话，却知道没人能保证永远”改成“即使听到了，越喜欢越觉得时间过得快”，改变了原本的心理动机，X的因果逻辑更准确清楚。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用加亮的关键词让观众很快抓住每段心理变化，感受文字又按音乐进程分批出现，降低了一次性阅读负担。船、水、摇荡、靠岸等意象反复呼应，加上对声部、力度、停顿和情绪转折的具体描写，使前后更有连续性，感受也更细腻。X的优势是完整因果句更多，人物为什么犹豫、放松、害怕和重新接纳自己的感情，解释得更充分；但整体观看体验我更倾向Y。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f01ce31f-2150-4fcf-a328-f884d23fc30d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T231835056095Z", "elapsed_seconds": 100.422, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T23:20:15.490274+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "47669e3842437bcecd8d626de29fdae4fc594472599021670d72cb393cfee5f5", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_w